# Build context for infrastructure/deployment/droplet/Dockerfile (the API image). Only the backend and the workspace package it
# imports are needed; everything else keeps the context small and secrets out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
apps
packages/ui
packages/api-client
documentation
infrastructure/monitoring
infrastructure/storage
backend/tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.md
